      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp = FastAPI()\nlamp = {\"on\": False}\n\n\n@app.get(\"/lamp\")\ndef read_lamp():\n    return lamp\n\n\n@app.post(\"/lamp/toggle\")\ndef toggle():\n    lamp[\"on\"] = not lamp[\"on\"]\n    return lamp\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp = FastAPI()\nlamp = {\"on\": False}\n\n\n@app.get(\"/lamp\")\ndef read_lamp():\n    return lamp\n\n\n@app.post(\"/lamp/toggle\")\ndef toggle():\n    lamp[\"on\"] = not lamp[\"on\"]\n    return lamp\n```"
